1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Welcome back to the garden show. Today we're planting tomatoes, and we'll talk about the right soil for them.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Thanks, Marta. The first thing I check is the weather. Tomatoes don't like a cold night, so I wait until late spring.

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:44,000
And how deep do you put the young plants? I always worry that the stem breaks when I press the soil down.

4
00:00:44,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Deeper than you think. Bury two thirds of the stem & the plant grows new roots along it.

5
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:07,000
That's all for this week. Next time we talk about water.
